STEP 1 — DELTA
- NEW engagementplatform.n26.com: Cloudflare-fronted JSON API; `/users` + `/events` gated by `Authorization: Bearer <key>` (401 `{"message":"Invalid API key: <key>"}`); `/internal/*` routed to a separate nginx origin, all 404 (2 origins behind one hostname). No unauth routes found.
- NEW pay.n26.com: Cloudflare+CloudFront edge; `/pay` and all `/pay/*` return a generic Stripe Checkout shell (564,105B, `<title>Stripe Checkout</title>`, js.stripe.com); all other paths 403 at edge — payment logic is third-party (api.stripe.com/v1).
- NEW 3ds-challenge.n26.com: `awselb/2.0`, HTTP 403 on all methods incl OPTIONS — ALB/WAF default-deny; 3DS challenge is session-bound.
- NEW passive-DNS subdomain set (hackertarget hostsearch): clicks.accounts.n26.com, clicks.emails.n26.com, docs.n26.com, static.app.n26.com, static.n26.com, static.support.n26.com, mag*/.mag-de/-es/-fr/-it, join/get/next/tutorials — CloudFront static/marketing, INFO expected, unprobed.
- CHANGED keyless auth-service: unchanged since last cycle (LIVE 404 Istio/Envoy, WS routes `path unused`); scope ruling still pending.

